# --- ignored when building the API image ---

# we COPY only the files we need in the Dockerfile, so this list is mainly
# defensive against accidental "COPY ." additions later.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/.astro
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# never ship local secrets or local-disk uploads
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

apps/api/uploads/
